---
description: Architecture and implementation rules
---

Follow the architecture chosen in `agent_docs/tech_stack.md` and `agent_docs/code_patterns.md`. Reuse existing modules before adding abstractions. Do not change MCP servers, provider credentials, or AI tool permissions without explicit approval. Follow the authorization rules in `AGENTS.md`: editing auth, billing, infrastructure, or migration source is ordinary work in scope; confirm authorization before applying it to a live system, deploying, sending externally, or changing access.
